:''For the enemy units, see [[Cyclops (Enemy)]] and [[4D Cyclops (Enemy)]].''
'''Cyclops''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked during the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]] by completing the stage [[Mucha! I'm So Excited!]] with a [[Timed Score Reward|Timed Score]] of at least 4,500. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 4.6 slightly increased attack range.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 255
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Cyclops
|name2 = Cyclops of Steel
|name3 = 4D Cyclops
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cyclops of Steel''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''4D Cyclops''' when obtained from the [[Road to Cyclops Evolution (Hard)|Road to Cyclops Evolution]] stage and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is essentially a slower and far less damaging version of [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Lizard Cat]], without any of the damage and almost 3x the recharge. It might be useful for increasing [[User Rank]] and can be stacked in early Stories of Legend stages for some DPS, but even in {{4c}} it will be outclassed by [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]].

The levels it shines most in are the levels in the Castle Dragon VS Castle Dragon event, due to the restriction of only Castle & Dragon units, it becomes one of the only reliable sources of DPS alongside [[Golem (Special Cat)|Golem]]. Otherwise, it's near useless.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

